        <mxCell id="title" value="ỨNG DỤNG QUẢN LÝ CHẤT LƯỢNG DỮ LIỆU KHÁCH HÀNG&lt;br&gt;(Luồng L7 – Mekong Mobile)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F3B63;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="40" width="700" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uc1" value="&lt;b&gt;UC1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nhập file khách hàng" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#1F3B63;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=15;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="110" width="240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uc2" value="&lt;b&gt;UC2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Xem danh sách&lt;br&gt;lần nhập" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#B7950B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=15;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="215" width="240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
